# Requests for a local API with demo data (`npm run db:seed`).
# Open in VS Code (REST Client extension) or a JetBrains IDE (HTTP Client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Readiness: 200 once the database is reachable and migrated
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Service types
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/service-types

@dealershipId = 01a16194-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### Technicians of a dealership, with their skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/{{dealershipId}}/technicians

### Service bays of a dealership
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/{{dealershipId}}/bays
